# Vercel AI Gateway — one key unlocks every provider/model the arcade can play as.
#
# You normally DON'T need this file: on first run the arcade signs you in to
# Vercel (a `vercel login`-style browser flow), asks which team to bill, and
# mints a gateway key for you automatically. Press `s` anytime to switch team,
# `o` (on the menu) to sign out, or run with `--login` / `--switch-team` /
# `--logout`.
#
# Arcade and its model-testing tools use the cached Vercel login and ignore
# inherited shell keys. They mint a process-local AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY only for
# the lifetime of the command, so no Gateway credential belongs in this file.
